ze every trip back to your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555500/extras/c155a9e68318e9faf0d00c38345a6664.poster.avif?t=1773387854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555500/extras/c155a9e68318e9faf0d00c38345a6664.webm?t=1773387854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555500/extras/c155a9e68318e9faf0d00c38345a6664.mp4?t=1773387854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maintain and Upgrade the Store</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item needs attention before it hits the shelves. Engage in satisfying minigames to bring life back to discarded goods:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning: Scrub off the grime and dirt with a dedicated cleaning minigame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair: Use your workbench to restore items to better condition, boosting their potential sale price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evaluate: Visit an expert to evaluate the true value of your items. Be wary of bootlegs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555500/extras/fce32c7eac76a4ec9f33b068bde088c1.poster.avif?t=1773387854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555500/extras/fce32c7eac76a4ec9f33b068bde088c1.webm?t=1773387854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555500/extras/fce32c7eac76a4ec9f33b068bde088c1.mp4?t=1773387854\" type=\"video/mp4\"