sonally clean up and organize the newly acquired property before it’s ready to become your next retail hotspot.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the keen eye of a deal-maker, the steady hand of a restorer, and the business sense of a mogul? Test your skills and build a salvage empire in Salvage Shop Simulator!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Enter the world of shopkeepers trading in reclaimed goods! Bid for the best items at auction, prepare and clean the bought items, and then sell them in your shop. Test your skills and watch your business grow!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Hungarian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555500/a06a0349931059a2be52ea13d548859866389f7c/header.jpg?t=1773387854", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555500/9d99c72353cb2121c45574fb05ced70fa4343e1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773387854", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555500/9d99c72353cb2121c45574fb05ced70fa4343e1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773387854", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-11400H,  AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1650 6GB VRAM,    Radeon RX 590<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 13 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["GameFormatic S.A."], "publishers": ["GameFormatic S.A."], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "